WEBVTT

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.874
When you watch an Aikido black belt
martial artist,

00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:14.080
you'll notice sage in action.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.370
In Aikido,
rather than blocking or opposing the

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.829
forward momentum and energy of your
opponent,

00:00:21.829 --> 00:00:25.439
you align with it and use it to your
advantage.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.985
You use your opponent's powerful forward
momentum to throw him in the direction

00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:37.560
you want by aligning with your opponent's
energy rather than opposing it.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.487
The stronger the aggressive energy of
your opponent,

00:00:42.487 --> 00:00:46.080
the easier your job will be in throwing
him down.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.576
Once you align yourself with that energy
today,

00:00:49.576 --> 00:00:54.040
you can practice doing the same thing
against your saboteurs.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:59.454
The sage perspective is that everything
can be converted into a gift and

00:00:59.454 --> 00:01:02.760
opportunity,
and that includes your saboteurs.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.959
So today,
consider your saboteurs to be your black

00:01:07.959 --> 00:01:09.360
belt sage trainers.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:14.615
They'll come at you to try to throw you
to the ground and hijack you,

00:01:14.615 --> 00:01:17.480
and you use that energy to your advantage.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.740
Every time you notice your saboteurs
coming at you to hijack you,

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:27.720
use that incoming energy as a wake-up
call to energize your sage.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:33.800
The best way to do that is to suddenly
become fully aware of your body.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:39.631
Notice your body, occupy your body,
feel your body on your seat or on your

00:01:39.631 --> 00:01:43.086
feet,
and from that place of body awareness do

00:01:43.086 --> 00:01:48.818
some PQ reps to prevent yourself
from being thrown off by the attacking

00:01:48.818 --> 00:01:49.480
saboteur.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:54.560
Every time you do this,
you become a little stronger in your

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.400
self-command and your sage.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:59.960
You convert your saboteur into your black
belt

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.280
sage trainer.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.640
Notice the Aikido strategy here.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.560
You don't get upset at your saboteur.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.543
You use its incoming energy to wake your
sage up,

00:02:11.543 --> 00:02:14.840
energize your body and do some PQ
reps.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.640
Good luck and have fun with the practice.
